window.products.push({"id":796035,"name":"SCS Direct Star Trek Picard Stemless Wine Glasses, Set of 2 - Season 3 Chateau Picard Crest Logo Design, 17 oz - Next Generation Gift for Adults, Men,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nr734MKcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Valentines Day, surprise your favorite Star Trek fan with this set of Star Trek Chateau Picard Stemless Wine Glasses! The next generation of wine glasses is here! The 17 oz glasses feature the Jean-Luc Picard family crest and wine logo as shown in the hit television series Star Trek: Picard. Boldly go where no wine enthusiast has gone before! Perfect for red or white wine, these Chateau Picard stemless glasses will surely delight any Star Trek fan! Get ready for Season 3! Makes an excellent gift for men and women who love Star Trek - and wine! Perfect for Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentine's Day, Christmas, holidays, birthdays, anniversaries and more! Officially licensed Star Trek merchandise. Lead-free Glass. 17 oz each. Dishwasher safe, hand wash recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nr734MKcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SCS Direct","source_asin":"B08B7998JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B7998JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B7998JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796036,"name":"AXTEE Key Holder for Wall - Wall Mount Key and Mail Holder with 4 Double Key Hooks and Mail Organizer - Key Rack for Home Entryway Decor, (16.5”W x 4.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwPsOly9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Function Storage: AXTEE Key Holder is consist of a mail slot and 4 double hooks, it is convenient for your mail, keys, umbrellas, pet collars and other common items, it also has a floating shelf for knick-knacks. If you have any product quality problems when you receive the product, please contact us, we can solve your problem without returning. High-Quality Wood: The key rack made of solid pine wood and solid metal double hooks, strong load-bearing capacity and durability. The metal mail organizer and a premium wood shelf creates an elegant and sophisticated look Stylish Appearance: The decorative wall-mounted key holder features a rustic design with original wood grain, making it a fashionable addition to any home decor style Easy to Install: There are no complicated installation steps, and this key rack can be easily installed with only two holes and it is very stable(Tips: the distance between the two holes needs to be measured and then determined) Widely Use: Key hooks decorative for wall can be used in the porch, kitchen, study, or bedroom to keep your space tidy and organized.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwPsOly9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AXTEE","source_asin":"B0B7757HNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7757HNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7757HNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796037,"name":"Peugeot Fidji 6 inch Black Matte Salt/Pepper Mill Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RQh52vexL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Advantage of Freshly Ground Spices There are many benefits to freshly grinding pepper, salt, herbs and spices for cooking and seasoning. A quality mill with a specifically designed grinding mechanism will release the aromas and essential oils of that spice. Freshly ground pepper and spices have more aroma and better flavor than pre- ground. Another advantage of using freshly ground spices or minerals (salts) is the control a mill provides for determining the coarseness (size) of a grind. A high quality pepper, salt or spice mill gives you the ability to choose and change the coarseness according to taste or necessity. How to Choose a Good Mill When looking for a pepper, salt or spice grinder, consider the following: Grinding mechanism: Choose a grinding mechanism that can withstand daily use: one that is well made and produces a consistent grind. Ideally, the grinding mechanism should be designed to handle a specific spice, as each spice has different physical characteristics that will benefit from different design features. Design and appearance: Whether it's traditional or modern, manual or electric, a mill can be an indispensable tool in your kitchen and a beautiful part of table decor. Ease of Use: A quality mill should be easy to adjust, easy to fill, and feel comfortable in the hand. History of Peugeot Peugeot's story starts in the 19th century when the Peugeot brothers converted the family's gristmill into a steel foundry. They began producing award winning hand tools immediately after opening and went on to produce a diverse range of exceptional quality products including small appliances, bicycles and most notably, automobiles. (Although now operating as a separate company, the Peugeot car company continues the same commitment to quality and innovation that is a Peugeot hallmark). In 1840 Peugeot created their burr style coffee grinder and adopted that design to accommodate peppercorns in 1874. The resulting pepper mechanism design is still used today in every Peugeot pepper mill. Peugeot's iconic pepper grinding mechanism design is often copied, but never equaled. Today, Peugeot offers six unique spice-specific mechanisms plus the original burr-style coffee grinder. There are no shortcuts: each mechanism is designed to get the most out of the spices they are intended for. After more than 160 years, Peugeot mills and grinders remain the benchmark of the industry and have earned their position as the mill of choice in world class kitchens. It's All About the Mechanism The primary difference between Peugeot and all other brands are the spice-specific mechanisms. Peugeot has 7 unique spice specific mechanisms for pepper, salt, herbs and spices, coffee, wet salt, chili peppers and nutmeg. For each spice, there is one - and only one - Peugeot grinding mechanism, each made of the ideal design and constructed from the best material available for its intended use. Peugeot's Pepper Grinding Mechanism is a two stage burr-style system. During production, the helix-shaped grooves and grinding teeth of the pepper mechanism are individually cut before the steel is case hardened to make it virtually indestructible. The mechanism is then given a proprietary treatment to provide additional protection against corrosion. During use, the helix- shaped grooves guide whole peppercorns through the mechanism to crack, then grind to a consistent size by a double row of teeth. This process releases the pepper's essential oils, resulting in more flavor and aroma for your dish. This patented mechanism is found on every Peugeot Pepper mill and is widely considered the best pepper mechanism available Peugeot's Salt Crushing Mechanism features two ribbed plates which work to fracture and crush coarse, dry sea salt to a consistent size. The salt grinding mechanism is made of corrosion resistant Stainless Steel, and is found on every Peugeot Salt Mill. Peugeot's Spice Mechanism is made of ceramic, and is specially designed to grind dried spices and flat leafy herbs to release their essential oils. It is particularly effective with dried aromatic herbs such as thyme, parsley, basil, oregano, and herbs de Provence, as well as dried seeds such as cumin. Peugeot's Chili Pepper Mechanism is made of case hardened steel for optimal hardness and resilience. This patented mechanism features a pre-cutting system and dual chamber reservoir. For use with dry, hot chilis such as birds tongue, African devils and Piri Piri. The Nutmeg Shaving Mechanism is made of treated stainless steel which is corrosion resistant, and offers superior edge retention. The Peugeot nutmeg shaver is equipped with a double stainless steel grater blade and a strong claw which enables the whole nutmeg to be very finely shaved, while keeping fingers safe. Intended for use with whole nutmeg nuts. Peugeot's Wet Salt mechanism has been specially designed for wet sea salt: a spiral guides the salt, ensuring that it does not stick together. The mechanism is made of ceramic ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RQh52vexL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B002DMLDWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002DMLDWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002DMLDWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
