window.products.push({"id":796075,"name":"LUCID 14 Inch Memory Foam Bed Mattress Conventional, Twin XL, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yftIQJHtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Feel This mattress has a medium to medium-plush feel. Dual Memory Foam Layers Two memory foam layers make sure you won't bottom out. The top layer, made of 3 inches of ventilated gel memory foam, contours to you, sinking you farther into the mattress. As that layer forms to your body, the second supportive layer, a 2 inch layer of ventilated bamboo charcoal infused memory foam, is there to give you a soft landing spot. If you're someone who lacks a good night's rest due to back, neck, or shoulder pains, then memory foam is the way to go. The memory foam has a 5.3 pound density and also helps to isolate motion transfer between sleeping partners. Ventilated The dual memory foam layers have been ventilated for air flow, helping you to sleep cooler. Safe for You and the Environment This foam is CertiPUR-US certified which means it has been independently tested for materials used, physical performance, and environmental stewardship. Careful construction guarantees no prohibited phthalates, no ozone depleters, no CFCs, no mercury, no lead or heavy metals, no formaldehyde, no PBDEs, and low emission (VOCs) for indoor air quality. This mattress does not contain synthetic or natural latex of any kind. 10-Year U.S. Warranty We gladly offer a 10-Year U.S. Warranty. This warranty protects the mattress and cover against manufacturer's defects. Conveniently Shipped for Easy Set Up All of our products are shipped vacuum packed, so your mattress is easy to transport and set up. After your mattress arrives, simply take the package into the right room, remove it from the box and protective wrap, and then watch as it expands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yftIQJHtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCID","source_asin":"B0063OQOTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0063OQOTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0063OQOTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
