window.products.push({"id":796094,"name":"Fairy Dust Incense 25 sticks with crystals","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G9OFnLZzL._AC_.jpg","description":"~Fairy Dust Stick Incense w/ FREE Crystals~ Fresh, Hand Crafted, Stick Incense 25 in a bag Handcrafted, Blessed Aged Fresh lemon peel creates a sparkling accent for the sunny fruit accord that opens this fragrance. A rich fruity floral signature balances night blooming jasmine with fresh cassis, while hints of ozone create a shimmering effect. Complex musk tones intertwine with rare woods and a hint of vanilla at the base of the scent. Each stick will burn for up to a hour each, enhancing the mood of any room, by releasing the premium essences slowly and gently the air. These blends and incense are never mass produced, I make only 400 sticks at a time. This is my way of ensuring an incense with a higher quality,fresh aroma,and longer burn each and every time. I soaked these sticks in this blend of oils for 3 weeks before I cure them naturally, never hurried. This allows the oils to saturate into the sticks, mellow fragrance and cause a slower burning rate. I played with this batch. I am a healer, so I ask to turned on, which means , I ask Spirit to send my mana, prana, essence, whatever you wanna call it, to enter into the incense whenever I handling the incense sticks. Then I placed a Moldavite stone in the oil for 2 weeks and then used my Teslas purple plate on them while they aged. I like how using all these methods has enhanced my scents and I hope you will enjoy them as much as I do. Each bag of incense comes with free intuited little crystals for you personally! Could be, Apache Tears, Turquoise, Rose Quartz, etc., depending on what I get you need...! The size of the stones doesnt matter...the crystals will STILL amp and balance. They will be placed inside each bag of incense you order.. Small stones have many uses, tape on to forehead in mediation, put in medicine bag, make earrings, hidden easily in pillow case, great offerings to the fairy realm, chakra healing, ect, they are cheaper to mail. . Fairy Dust incense by shamamomma","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G9OFnLZzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"shamamomma","source_asin":"B009B57MQA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009B57MQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009B57MQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
