window.products.push({"id":796128,"name":"Gordon Ramsay Maze 5-Piece Pasta Bowl Set, Teal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCOLncr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"World-renowned chef Gordon Ramsay exemplifies performance and presentation; epitomized by his namesake Oven-to-Tableware Collection. Featuring a range of multifunctional porcelain products that can be used to bake, roast, cook and serve, the collection is characterized by an elegant and contemporary design and restaurant-grade durability. This 5-Piece Pasta Set is rendered in a subtle Teal glaze and decorated with embossed concentric circles that attract the eye towards the center of each dish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCOLncr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gordon Ramsay","source_asin":"B00EA1OCLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EA1OCLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EA1OCLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796129,"name":"100% Cotton Bed Sheets Set: Breathable Bedding Sets with Flat Sheet, Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet and 1 Pillowcase - Soft and Comfortable Sheets Made with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wtMO33H7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER SOFT  There’s nothing worse than laying down for a night of rest in scratchy, uncomfortable sheets. These cotton sheets from Isabella Cromwell are here to deliver the comfort you desire. Made with 100% pure brushed cotton, our sheets are silky soft and get more cozy with every wash. The premium fabric will give you a luxury hotel feel in your own home.   COOL AND DRY  Our sheets are designed for ultimate comfort, no matter the season. We use Super Kool-Cotton technology which combines our exclusive fiber finish and patented brushing process to wick away moisture and keep you cool and comfortable during hot summer nights. Though lightweight and breathable, the woven fabric also provides great insulation to keep you cozy and warm throughout the winter.   COOL CRISP PERCALE WEAVE  Get ready for the best night’s sleep you’ve had in a while. Each of the sheets in our set features a tight percale weave for a stronger, denser and softer fabric. Feel the comfort as you slide into bed and settle in for the night. The closely woven fabric made of brushed cotton will provide years of coziness and will only get softer and more comfortable after each launder.   COMPLETE SET  Our bedding set has everything you need to create a cozy sleeping space. In each set you’ll find a flat sheet as well as a deep pocket fitted sheet designed to fit mattresses up to 17 inches. You’ll also receive matching pillowcase to fully complete the set. Pair with your favorite comforter or quilt or use the set solo. No matter which you choose, you’ll be sleeping in comfort and style.   VIBRANT COLORS  Our sheet sets come in a variety of basic and unique colors. Choose from classic white or one of our colorful, fade resistant hues. The many color choices makes it easy to match any bedroom decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wtMO33H7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISABELLA CROMWELL","source_asin":"B07FL2FQSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FL2FQSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FL2FQSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796130,"name":"EcoQuest Living Air Classic Alpine Xl-15 Fresh Air Purifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9195xCesr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Living Air Classic utilizes a synergy of ion generation technology and controlled low-level ozone generation to effectively remove smoke and odors from indoor environments. A very powerful and reliable air purifier, Living Air Classic quietly and efficiently works to remove smoke and odors day after day with a simplicity and ease of adjustment found on few appliances today. Living Air Classic is designed and built with long-standing, proven technology for a reliable, easy-to-adjust solution to indoor smoke and odors. Whether it's smoke from cooking, tough to eliminate tobacco smoke, or just the odors they leave behind, Living Air Classic has the power to get the job done, leaving nothing but fresh-smelling, clear air where it's needed. This machine is truly the original set-it-and-forget-it 'thunderstorm in a box', producing a clean, fresh scent 24/7 with only regular scheduled maintenance and minimal adjustment needed to maintain effectiveness. Benefits of Living Air Classic: Quickly and effectively removes smoke from the air, including tobacco smoke Acts as a powerful deodorizer to reduce or eliminate the toughest odors Quiet operation for a non-intrusive solution Low maintenance requiring no filters (uses a lint screen to help keep the interior of the unit free of dust and dirt and optional filtration is available) Reproduces the clean, fresh scent of a thunderstorm Simple and effective air purification that works. Pulsating negative/positive ion field generation Scalable ozone generation Variable speed fan Large coverage area Max 03 - 360 mg/hr Technology - Needlepoint ionization, RF pulse ionization, Scalable ozone Power Usage - 30 watts Lint Screens & Filters - Optional prefilter Optional pleated paper filter Applications - Homes, offices, light industrial Coverage - 3,000 ft2 Size - Size 8' wide x 11.75' high x 9.75' deep Weight - 16 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9195xCesr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EcoQuest","source_asin":"B00A1LMEAC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A1LMEAC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A1LMEAC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
