window.products.push({"id":796169,"name":"Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier, Portable Detachable Air Humidifiers for Bedroom, USB Powered, Whisper-Quiet, Timer Setting, and Night Light For Kids ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51L00Uho5pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description： Humidify your room in no time with the AMAES Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier that is designed to provide whisper-quiet operation and reliable performance. Specification： Water Tank: 250ml Working Time：Up to 4 hours Materials: PP/PC Input power: 5V/ 1A Coverage area: Around 100 square feet Spray quantity: 50-60ml/h How to operate the humidifier? 1.Short press the power button to turn on the mist and light. Short press again to turn off the light. 2.Long press the button about 2 seconds to turn on the light without mist. Long press agian to return to the previous state. Package Included: 1 x AMAES humidifier 1 x 1.2M USB cable 1 x Cotton swab 1 x User Manual Note： 1.Do not add water over MAX line(less water, more mist). 2.Please ONLY USE tap water or mineral water. DO NOT USE distilled water or purified water. 3.We recommend you clean the humidifier after each use to avoid clogging and other problems. Wipe the water tank by a clean cloth, and wipe the ultrasonic atomizer with a cotton swab.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51L00Uho5pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMAES","source_asin":"B07X5FXYKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X5FXYKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X5FXYKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796170,"name":"Nesaila Latex Mattress Topper Full 3.15 inch Double Layer, Bamboo Charcoal & Latex Mattress Pad, Cool Removable Bed Topper Cover, Medium Firmness (Twi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yiq-H1bqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌴【Eliminate Fatigue】🌴 The infrared rays emitted by bamboo charcoal make objects produce micro heat, accelerate the blood circulation of the human body, promote metabolism, improve the internal environment of the human body, achieve the effect of eliminating fatigue, ensure constant temperature and humidity, and improve sleep quality. 🌴【3.15 inch Thick, 30ILD/80D Density】🌴 Nesaila chooses 80D latex with higher density, fills it in the most ideal thickness of 3.15 inch, and designs the partitions according to the gravity distribution of different parts of the human body, and changes the pore pattern of the mattress accordingly. Divide the mattress into different supporting areas to support the cervical spine and waist.The human body comfort is greatly improved, effectively alleviating body pain. 🌴【Effective Combination of Bamboo Charcoal&Latex】🌴 Bamboo charcoal latex has the characteristics of high resilience touch, no cracking when folded, and multi-air vent structure. It is not easy to deform, giving you comfortable and effective support. The latex surface is slightly softer, and the bamboo charcoal surface is slightly harder. You can choose freely according to your own preferences. 🌴【Double-layer Breathable Mattress Cover】🌴 The zipper-designed cotton mattress cover is easy to remove and wash, soft and comfortable. More effective heat dissipation and exhaust, cool and breathable, the mattress and the human body breathe together. 🌴【Bamboo Charcoal Take Away Odors】🌴 Bamboo charcoal has an adsorption effect and can improve indoor air quality. The latex material has moderate hardness and is easy to crimp and store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yiq-H1bqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nesaila","source_asin":"B08GFFVG7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GFFVG7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GFFVG7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
