window.products.push({"id":796254,"name":"Smart Design Wash Bag w/ Safety Zipper - Washing Machine Safe - Fine Mesh Nylon Polyester - Bra, Hosiery, Pantyhose, Delicates, Lingerie, & Baby Cloth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-8rsZe4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smart Design Lingerie and Delicates Wash Bag [White] Lingerie Wash Bag protects multiple types of lingerie and clothing. The design allows for constant water flow for quick and even drying. Package Includes The lingerie wash bag is great for delicate items, bras, and panties. The design is perfect for keeping your delicates separate in the wash. Features and Benefits The durable material allows for constant water flow, making sure all of the clothing is cleaned thoroughly. Its strong and secure zipper will keep clothes intact in the washer and dryer; no need to worry about the clothes falling out. Product Specifications Dimensions: 0.1(L) x 14(W) x 18(H) inches Color: White Material: Durable Mesh Material Holds: Lingerie & Clothing Items Brand and Warranty Info People around the world live smarter with Smart Design, manufacturers of innovative, high-quality home and commercial organizational and laundry care products. Since 1970, Smart Design has set the standard of excellence in the Home Organization Industry by developing products that allow consumers to optimize their needs. Everything from your closet, kitchen, laundry room, home office, garage and auto to your workplace.  Located in Southern California, Smart Design is a family-owned company with customer service at the core of our business. If you have any questions, issues, or concerns about your order, reach out to our Customer Service Team via email anytime, 24/7. Our Team will do their best to respond to all emails within 24 hours. Visit us online for phone support Monday-Friday 8 am – 5 pm PST.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-8rsZe4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Design","source_asin":"B005MJFFNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005MJFFNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005MJFFNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
