window.products.push({"id":796326,"name":"Homeries Unpolished Granite Mortar and Pestle Set - Heavy Stone for Enhanced Performance – Spice Grinder Pesto Bowl for Crushing, Grinding Seasonings,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CCuSgE8RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Can you imagine a kitchen without a mortar and pestle set? It’s one of the first few things every person should get when moving out. Compared to an electric grinder, the mortar and pestle manual grinding method leads to better smelling and tasting food, as all the flavor and aroma from the ingredients are properly released. This is especially evident in cuisines that incorporate a lot of spices and herbs. This set is made from unpolished hard granite stone that provides the most natural friction for effortless grinding. This heavy stone also ensures that the ingredients do not spill over during the crushing and grinding process, making sure your countertops remain spotless. This mortar pestle set can be used for crushing, grinding, pulverizing, and powdering all sorts of ingredients. They can be used with spices, seeds, nuts, as well as sauces and condiments such as guacamole, salsa, pesto, chutneys, and many more! You can also it to crush pills your kid or pet refuses to take! The large mortar bowl ensures you will always have enough spice mix for your dish without any of it spilling over! So go on and set the culinary world on fire with this granite mortar and pestle set! Features: Mortar & pestle set Mortar & pestle set Made of unpolished granite Made of unpolished granite Lessens friction for effortless grinding Lessens friction for effortless grinding Large capacity mortar bowl Large capacity mortar bowl Anti-slip grip on pestle Anti-slip grip on pestle Heavy stone won’t upturn & cause a mess Heavy stone won’t upturn & cause a mess Helps bring out full flavors & aromas of ingredients Helps bring out full flavors & aromas of ingredients High-quality & durable product High-quality & durable product Kitchen essential  Package Includes:   1 x Homeries Granite Mortar  1 x Homeries Granite Pestle Kitchen essential Package Includes: 1 x Homeries Granite Mortar  1 x Homeries Granite Pestle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CCuSgE8RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homeries","source_asin":"B0821THG6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0821THG6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0821THG6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
