window.products.push({"id":796389,"name":"Homace Foldable Neck Fan with Cooling and Heating Pad, with traveling case, 4000mAh Rechargeable Battery Operated, Wearable Personal Fan, Refrigerated","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pPQXDKxcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cool and Safe- An amazing neck fan that helps you cool down by simply turning it on and placing it around your neck. It's designed to be safe for everyone, from children to the elderly. The neck fan has a 45-degree adjustable swing, so you can arrange the airports where you want the air to flow. It also has a 360-degree flexible frame that allows you to bend and twist the frame and set the neck fan to optimize the fan fully. It is a novel neck fan that sends the wind flowing to you without you having to use your hands, and all you need to do is simply place it around your neck. Due to its flexible and petite frame, you can use it in multiple ways that best suit the user. It's also fun and easy to use for the elderly and children. Hands-free & Modern- we designed the Neck fan to be hands-free, allowing you to work, play, or relax while staying cool during the summer and warm in winter. In addition, the Modernistic style makes you look like you're wearing a pair of stylish headphones while staying cool/ warm throughout the year. It provides 360 degrees of air movement to keep your face cool without blowing air directly onto it. In addition, the hands-free device is so lightweight that you'll forget you're wearing it. The neck fan is made without wings and bladeless, so you don't have to worry about your hair getting stuck. It's also safe and fun for kids to wear and enjoy. Not only is this product lightweight, and it has three powerful speeds that will keep you cool whenever and wherever you need it. In addition, it's very convenient to charge the battery with the USB cord that comes with it. Two to Ten Running hrs & 3 Speed settings- There are three fan speeds to choose from, interchangeable cooling and a heating pad, and the rechargeable battery, which will last anywhere from 2 to 10 hours at a time, depending on the speed setting. In addition, the battery has a 4000mAh, allowing you to experience the fan on a single charge for long periods. You can adjust the fan speed by pressing the power button repeatedly. The neck fan can be charged with a USB-C cord that comes with it, making it super convenient and easy for you to charge also anywhere you go. The neck fan is fantastic for long days outside, as it can last up to 10 hours, and you don't have to carry it around. In addition, it's easily foldable to make it easy and comfortable for you to travel with them when it's not around your neck. Stay Cool while you Work: The flexible frame allows you to mold the neck fan to prevent it from moving while being active. So, the Homace neck fan will stay on your neck no matter what you're doing or where you are. The rechargeable battery lasts up to Ten hours, which is enough time for most people to get through the day without having to charge it again; this makes it perfect for use during office hours and at home during the hot summer months. Because it is a lightweight and portable fan, it is ideal for people who like to travel. This personal neck fan is a value-for-your-money for those who want to stay cool during those hot summer days or keep warm during the cold winter months. Cooling and Heating Pad-The Homace Neck fan delivers both cooling and heating. It has a 3-speed fan mode, cooling, and heating mode. The neck pad is excellent in providing warmth during those cold winter months and nice and cool during the hot summer months. When it's on the cooling mode, the fan can cool down by 18 degrees; when it's on heating mode, it'll heat up to 100 degrees—keeping you nice and cool/warm throughout the day. It's like carrying a portable air conditioner; It is bladeless, making it a safe option for those who worry about coming into contact with the blades of a regular fan. The neck design also gives you the opportunity to adjust the angle so that you can get the right amount of airflow where ever you need it most, whether that's on your neck, face, chest, or anywhere else. It makes a fantastic gift for everyone all year round.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pPQXDKxcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homace","source_asin":"B0BCXMXNML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCXMXNML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCXMXNML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
