window.products.push({"id":796394,"name":"Trivet Weave mat kitchen table mats Round Woven Placemats Trivet Mat Set Woven Placemats for Hot Dishes/Pot/Bowl/Teapot/Hot Pot Holders/11.8 Inches (W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Ipsy1xHL._AC_SL1298_.jpg","description":"Weaving, as one of the representatives of traditional handwork, not only reflects the diligence and wisdom of workers, but also reflects the attitude towards life and the pursuit of quality of life. The Feature of the Trivet table mat: Cattail fragrance: When you use this weave mat Trivet,you will find that the lovely, fragrant smell of cattail enveloped you, bringing you a positive mood and a pleasant state of mind. Protective pot holders for kitchen: On the one hand,the non-slip table mats are able to resist 212℉(100℃)heat, protecting your good dining table which enable you to enjoy the baked freshest food without worry about the superheat damage to the table. On the other hand,the placemat can properly protect table from scratch.  Decorative woven placemat: It is not only a practical mat, but also a very good decoration. Great decorative for bedroom, living room, kitchen, dining table and perfect display for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Halloween, wedding, party, and banquet.Meanwhile,it can be used as a placemat, heat insulation mat, flower pot mat or even to hang on wall as decorative plates or an ideal housewarming gift, to adding more fun to your home kitchen table. Reusable Trivet Mats： Since the raw material of the hot pads is cattail, please wash it with water and dry it when the placemats are dirty and store them in a dry area .It will protect our mat and use it for a long time. (Note: Please clean with water before the first use) Perfect after-sale service: If you have any suggestion or dissatisfaction with anything you have bought from us, we will gladly exchange your purchase, or refund your money, whichever you prefer. Package includes: 4pcs woven placemats Product size: 11.8 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Ipsy1xHL._AC_SL1298_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Garkup","source_asin":"B08ND2XL5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ND2XL5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ND2XL5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
