window.products.push({"id":796460,"name":"Mulberry Park 100% Pure Twin X-Long Silk Fitted Sheet 22 Momme 6A Mulberry Silk Bed Sheets with 15\" Deep Pocket - Breathable, Ultra-Soft, Oeko-TEX Cer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":221.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xe3jrI25L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made Of: 100% 22 Momme Charmeuse, Grade 6a Mulberry Silk Ultra Soft And Breathable: Mulberry Park Silk charmeuse sheets are all made of 100% pure Mulberry silk. Silk helps limit abrasion of the skin, helps retain moisture and is beneficial in limiting wrinkles. Dermatologists, Hairstylists and Beauty Experts all recommend silk for those with sensitive skin or acne! What You Will Receive: 100% pure 22 Momme - One Twin X-Long Silk Fitted Sheet (39\" x 80\" with a 15\" Deep Pocket). Order an extra set for when you are laundering or just want to give as a gift. Our silk is OEKO-TEX Certified (Standard 100) and dyed with no color shading or fading. Sleep Better, Sleep Beautifully: With our ultra-soft and smooth silk sheets, wake up with healthier skin, less tangles, less frizzy hair or bed head - imagine your mornings with smoother and more manageable hair! Mulberry Park Silk fabric is designed to help regulate your body temperature. Silk sheets will feel cooler to your skin in the summer and warmer in the winter and will help you to get a good night's sleep. Many Benefits Of Silk: Our silk bedding contain 18 different amino acids that are used in many high-end body lotions, skin and hair treatment products - just imagine the benefits of sleeping in silk! Silk is a breathable fabric helping to retain moisture, limits wrinkles and is a wonderful source of nourishment and maintenance for your hair and skin. Our 22 Momme silk has high tensile strength, making it strong and durable. Our silk sheets are also machine washable. Proud American Company: Mulberry Park Silk was named \"Best Overall Sheet Set\" by both Women's Health and CNN's online magazine in its recent ranking of top silk bedding. Additionally, this pillowcase is ranked in Oprah Magazine as one of the \"Best Silk Pillowcases\". As a silk loving company located in CT, we know nothing is more important than a great night's sleep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xe3jrI25L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mulberry Park Silks","source_asin":"B084WR3PYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084WR3PYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084WR3PYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
