window.products.push({"id":796603,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser, Touchless Infrared Motion Sensor, Hand Sanitizer Dispenser 700ml/24oz Wall Mount Hand Free, Touch-Free Liquid Dispenser for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z4k33AfuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sensitive and Touchless--This soap dispenser uses an infrared motion sensor, making it efficient and sensitive upon detection of hands and release the soap. It helps you wash without the need to touch grimy surfaces. Large Volume But Saving Space--This soap dispenser has a large capacity of 700ml, which means you don't have to refill it that often. It can be easily mounted on any wall saving much space. Widely Use--This soap dispenser is ideal for most liquid soaps and you can use it in any interior design such as office, hotel, hospital, kindergarten, toilet, bathroom, kitchen and more. Instruction Note: 1.Install the dispenser 40CM/15inch above the table top, in case it keeps dispensing soap. 2. Don’t install on the mirror surface or under strong direct light, reflection & strong light will harm the infrared sensor. 3. Don’t install it in shower room, this is not a waterproof product. 4. Suggest Drilling installation for commercial places. 5. Use non-granular, non-foaming liquid soap or hand sanitizer gel. 6. First time use, operate the dispenser several times to pump the air out. 7. Low Battery Indication：LED lights blinks fast to remind you to change new batteries. 8. Maintenance: Clean the outlet regular to avoid clogging, filling warm water and operate several times. 9. All products are tested with water before delivery, it is normal if there is little water exist. Package Includes 1 x Automatic soap dispenser 1 x Key 3 x Soft shell 3 x Screw 1 x User manual function instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z4k33AfuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIUZKO","source_asin":"B09NMMQDY1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NMMQDY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NMMQDY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
