window.products.push({"id":796697,"name":"13” Silicone Splatter Screen Pan Cover with Folding Handle, Heat Insulation Cooling Mat, Strainer, Drain Board, Oil Splash Guard for Frying Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UaQanf6aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: 100% food grade silicone Material Features：BPA free, non toxic Color: Grey Size: 13”/33cm screen Temperature range: -40 centigrade~230 centigrade. Features: Protect yourself and your kitchen from splatters, and it can also be a Strainer and a Heat Insulation Cooling Mat. Package: 1 x Silicone Splatter Screen What makes our Silicone Splatter Screen different SILICONE MATERIAL. Our silicone material is a natural ingredient. It is food grade, with heat resistant, and nonstick which makes it easy to clean. Silicone rubber is generally non-reactive, stable, and resistant to extreme environments and temperatures from -148 to 572 °F while still maintaining its useful properties. Due to its natural properties and its ease of manufacturing and shaping, silicone material cost is higher. FOLDABLE HANDLE. Our foldable handle makes the splatter screen easy to storage. The rubber handle will allow added grip comfort and slip proof maneuvering. EASY CLEANING. No messy clean ups after frying or cooking. A quick wash with dish soap or wipe clean with damp cloth and air dry makes it suitable for daily use. Dishwasher safe. MULTI USE. It is a grease and splatter screen, strainer, cooling mat, as well as a drain board. As a pan cover/splatter screen, it prevents; grease and sauce splatters. Use as a strainer to strain fluid off cooking pot or any food preparation container as desired. Put across standard size sinks and use as a drain board. As a cooling mat/rack, it can cool fried or baked foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UaQanf6aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"orhemus","source_asin":"B08MTBZ5L9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MTBZ5L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MTBZ5L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
