window.products.push({"id":796717,"name":"Bamboo Tranquility Serenity Collection - Ultra Silky Soft 100% Bamboo Viscose - 4PC Bed Sheet Set - Hypoallergenic (Queen, True Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WCo9BAsKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our classic bed sheets are made from silky-soft bamboo fabric that’s twice as soft as cotton, giving you the most comfortable sheets on the planet, possibly the universe. It's machine washable and odor resistant, making it perfect for any bedroom. Just be sure to be careful putting them in a guest bedroom or your guests will never leave! Bamboo Sheets are simply the best sheets on the market plain and simple. With manufactures being dishonest about thread count it’s no wonder people are turning to Bamboo Sheets. Our 300 true thread count sheets will be softer and more durable than any supposed 1000 thread count sheet (hint:1000 thread count is actually just them counting individual threads multiple times aka lying). This practice of trying to stuff as many threads into a bedsheet is just plain wrong! The more threads pushed together the more plies break since they are so thin. Having these broken threads creates tiny balls of fiber called pills which make sheets very uncomfortable to sleep on. Our bamboo sheets are woven with very long and thick threads making them much softer and durable. Softer than cotton and not slippery like silk, bamboo more comfortable and cool, it is also more Eco friendly to produce than cotton bed sheets. Bamboo only takes 1/3 of the water cotton does, and it grows extremely quick. Not only that, but Bamboo also has so many other uses than cotton, it is truly a wonder plant that we should promote. It only makes sense to invest in good bamboo bed sheets, you spend almost half of your entire life sleeping, you owe it to yourself to be sleeping comfortably and cool with Bamboo bed sheets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WCo9BAsKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bamboo Tranquility","source_asin":"B01MXDDI87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MXDDI87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MXDDI87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
