window.products.push({"id":796719,"name":"AKEFUN Satin Pillowcase Taupe,Standard Size Set of 2(20×26 inches),Ultra Soft Wrinkle, Fade & Stain Resistant - Envelop Closure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mq3V-nAFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% MICROFIBER SATIN- Satin pillow cases provide ultra-soft, smooth and comfortable feel with a lustrous appearance-The material is treated with anti-static so that they won't absorb dust and cause static cling hair problems -Luxury satin pillowcase is noiseless, breathable and sensitive skin-friendly, making you a good sleeping all night. GOOD SATIN PILLOWCASE FOR HAIR AND SKIN-The silky satin pillowcases are treated with anti-static, so it can reduce the friction of beautiful curly hairstyles and reduce hair breakage, and also protect the hair from tangles and frizz-It will make you have a good sleep, and great for preventing facial sleep lines , dry skin and morning bed head because of the slip and smooth texture. BETTER CHOICE THAN SILK PILLOWCASE- The touch feel of microfiber satin likes silk with good breathability. The pillow covers are hypoallergenic, wrinkle-free, stain and fade-resistant. Besides, high quality satin is more durable and easier clean than silk pillowcases, which need professional cares.It can be machine wash cold , tumble dry low,cool iron if needed . ENVELOPE CLOSURE DESIGN WITH HEMMING-Envelope closure end design gives the elegant appearance and won't scratch other fabric. No zipper design make it more durable and easy to use. With exquisite workmanship, these pillow protectors are designed with hemming, even if they are washed many times, there will be no cracks in the seam of the pillowcase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mq3V-nAFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKEFUN","source_asin":"B08SC58H8D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SC58H8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SC58H8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
