window.products.push({"id":796765,"name":"Hephaestus Steam Iron 1200 Watt Nonstick Teflon Soleplate Variable Steam Spray Anti-Drip Self-Cleaning System with 8 Feet Retractable Cord","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FHfCzQGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your shirts, slacks, dresses, and entire wardrobe wrinkle-free with a premium steam iron from Hephaestus. Premium Functionality Each Steam Master is fitted with a teflon soleplate that heats up almost instantly, is safe on a wide variety of fabrics, and is nonstick. Simply fill the reservoir with water, and iron out wrinkles and creases in just a few passes. And with self-cleaning technology, and an auto-off function for safety, it will do everything you need while still protecting your clothes. Product Details: Teflon Soleplate Teflon Soleplate Spraying and Steam Shot Buttons Spraying and Steam Shot Buttons Fast Heating Surface Fast Heating Surface Free Movement Power Cord Free Movement Power Cord Heat Indicator Light Heat Indicator Light Easy Fill Water Tank Easy Fill Water Tank Satisfaction Guarantee Satisfaction Guarantee Get a premium Hephaestus Steam&Spray Iron by clicking \"Add to Cart\" above and you'll never have to worry about wrinkles again! OPERATION SAFE TIPBefore first use, remove any sticker, protective foil or storage cover from the soleplate. Heat up the iron to maximum temperature and iron over a piece of damp cloth for several minutes on the purpose of removing any residue on the soleplate.Hold the iron in a tilted position, by measuring cup, filling water into water tank from it, Make sure water should not exceed the Max level (250ml) as indicated on water tank. Prevent water from spilling over during ironingThe iron has an anti-drip function: if ironing garments for long time, soleplate temperature will fall off, the iron will stop coming out steam automatically and no water droplets can come out from soleplate.Do not allow the wire to be flipped while collecting the wire, keep it flat to avoid jamming","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FHfCzQGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hephaestus","source_asin":"B01MSY7I32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSY7I32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSY7I32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
