window.products.push({"id":796773,"name":"Coffee and Drinks Heated Sleeve Reusable Coffee Warmer with Portable USB Fast Charging Heats Cups, a Drink Holder with an Adjustable Sleeve, Type C US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mIsfRMr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ Not Your Typical Coffee Mug Warmer Set - Many coffee warmers require a heated coffee mug and a coffee heating pad or base that is plugged into a wall socket. This means you always must use the same cup for your heated mug of coffee, and you always need to be close to an electrical socket for the coffee heating pad. Our reusable heated sleeve sets you free and provides you with the flexibility to always keep a heated cup of your favorite drinks close and ready to go. ❤ Innovative Safe Heating Technology - Many mug warmer sets require an electrical outlet and use higher voltage. Our coffee mug warmer and hot drink sleeve holder uses Graphene Rapid Heating Technology. This ensures that your heated drink will stay at a specified temperature around 130°F for a long period of time when connected. This is achieved through using safe low voltage USB port technology. 🎁 Uniquely Designed - Many heated coffee mugs are just a single mug. It may not be convenient to always use the same mug or cup all the time. Our product has Velcro on both sides. It’s flat and flexible design enables it to fit around most mugs and cups tightly. This makes it convenient for changing and using different cups. Our heating technology is designed to be powered by USB ports which are found in cars, most office spaces, airports, planes, hotels, portable power banks, etc. 💖 Green, Reusable and Portable - Paper holders are not reusable and can’t proactively heat your cup. Our heated sleeve will keep your beverage hot and can be used on a variety of cups without handles. It does not contain a lithium battery. The sleeve is foldable and can be easily stored in your purse, backpack or carry-on when traveling. 🎁 Cable Included for Your Convenience - We have also included a type-C USB cable to make charging your sleeve even easier. Your satisfaction is important to us. If you have any problems with this coffee mug warmer set, please reach out to us and we will resolve any issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mIsfRMr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIEESWARM","source_asin":"B0BG4BJP7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG4BJP7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG4BJP7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
