window.products.push({"id":796820,"name":"5 Pairs Melamine Chopsticks. Reusable Luxury Chopstick Set. A Wooden Replacement Made With Non-Toxic Dishwasher Safe Melamine. (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o1gRhNgxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Everyone here at the Best Hostess loves these beautifully crafted Chinese Chopsticks, made even more practical with non slip ends. Food Grade Approved Alloy Melamine, they are NON TOXIC, NON ALLERGENIC and ODORLESS. Durable and strong, they won't break, bend, stain, splinter, swell, chip or corrode. Enjoy decades of use, we guarantee it! HOW TO USE CHOPSTICKS: Rest the bottom chopstick on the fourth finger and the base of your thumb to grip it. This stick doesn't move around. Use your thumb, forefinger and middle finger to grip the top stick, (much like using a pen), which you control up and down. About 1/3rd of the end of the chopstick should protrude from the top of your hand. Chinese, Japanese, Korean or Vietnamese food all taste better eaten with traditional Asian utensils. Chefs love them for plating delicate foods - they can be used one handed and are less likely to damage the food. A traditional gift for newlyweds, they are also a great Housewarming or Hostess present.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o1gRhNgxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KINGFINGER","source_asin":"B076GH4K8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076GH4K8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076GH4K8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796821,"name":"Yidepot Butterfly Canvas Print Wall Art for Bedroom: Heart Shaped Branches Surrounded by Colorful Butterflies Love Themed Picture for Teen Girls (12\"x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NP7ZEYgoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🦋 SIZE OF BUTTERFLY WALL DECOR: 12x12x0.8inch (LxWxH) with 1 panel. Each panel of butterfly pictures already stretched on solid, ready to hang 🦋 BUTTERFLY CANVAS WALL ART: On the heart-shaped branch tree, colorful butterflies stay on it. It means to keep the beautiful things in your heart, the high-definition printed canvas paintings, the butterflies look like they can dance at any time, vivid and beautiful. This is an impressive picture, whether your child or your baby's room, it’s a pleasant and cute canvas wall decoration 🦋 CANVAS & FRAME: HD giclee prints on glossy canvas with waterproof eco-solvent ink, resistant of UV & color fading for more than 30yrs. We use pine solid 2cm depth wood material frame, not susceptible to moisture, anti-oxidation, strong and wear-resistant.\"Butterfly\" is HD Print, not 3D 🦋 BRING YOUR WALL TO LIFE: Our butterfly heart print can fit in any room such as teen girls room wall decor living room, kids room wall art, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom,nursery. Also can be great gifts for boys, teen girls, friends, colleague or partner on Children's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Valentine's Day,New Year ect 🦋 WORRY-FREE AFTER-SALE: Our butterflies framed canvas arrive in 3-5 days, If you are not satisfied with our picture, please feel free to contact us, easy return and refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NP7ZEYgoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yidepot","source_asin":"B0C4GW2D2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4GW2D2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4GW2D2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796822,"name":"A Wide Variety of Gundam Build Fighters Anime Characters Wall Scroll Hanging Decor (Iori Rinko 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eeuzYG7tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[Quality Control] We use our own equipment to make order item, we will re-make to resolve any quality problems until we think it is good enough. Pictures were carefully selected, adjusted and edited, but each person's monitor has different color setting, the printing inks also have color deviation, if you are concerned about it must be 100% the same color as you saw in your monitor, please buy with caution. We promise that we will try to make product as best as we can, our old customers feedback could help you know how we did before. [Unforeseen Circumstances] We will pack item very carefully, if it was damaged in transit (low probability but uncontrolled), you could contact us, we promise re-ship for free in this case. [Manufacturing Process] This wall scroll is not directly printed with reactive ink(easy to make, but easily be damaged by water and sun), it is dye sublimation product (better color, anti water and sun, hard to make for many manual operation steps), we used top quality printer consumables UltraChrome DS Ink & Jetcol Digital Transfer Paper which were three times the cost of ordinary factory consumables. [Shipping Rate] This product will be shipped by USPS in 3 business days from China. Normally 75% orders take about 7 to 14 business days , 24% orders will take 14 to 28 business days for Customs inspection, about 1% order may be delayed for uncontrolled reasons. In that case , we will contact you to resolve our problem. [Customized Order] It can be customized according to your picture (Picture size must at least > 1000 x 1600, we suggest > 1500 x 2048), please contact us and send us your picture, after that we will send back you a sample, if you like the sample, you could place your order on our wall scroll, and please do send us your order id to help us know which order is your custom order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eeuzYG7tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KINGS ZW","source_asin":"B00SHMKT68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SHMKT68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SHMKT68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
