window.products.push({"id":796871,"name":"BIRDROCK HOME 68L Collapsible Single Round Laundry Hamper Basket - Grey & White Stripes Bin - Compact Dirty Clothes Organizer Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xA2rVuHwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester, Cotton EFFICIENT SPACE SAVER: Tailored for small bedrooms, apartments, dorm rooms, or closets, this collapsible hamper is designed to maximize space. It easily fits into small closets or bedroom corners while offering ample storage capacity for your dirty laundry. When not in use, the hamper conveniently collapses for compact storage LIGHTWEIGHT YET STURDY: Weighing just 0.9 lbs, this hamper is exceptionally lightweight, making transportation a breeze. Crafted with durable materials, it withstands frequent use in your bedroom, laundry room, or bathroom. The unique cloth handles ensure effortless carrying and added convenience ATTRACTIVE CLOTHES ORGANIZER: Say goodbye to unsightly laundry piles. Our stylish hamper keeps your dirty laundry neatly organized without compromising on aesthetics. Featuring a beautiful white and grey stripe design, it blends seamlessly with any room decor, making it suitable for kids, teens, college students, or adults GENEROUS CAPACITY: With a spacious interior, this single laundry hamper can hold up to 1 load of dirty clothes. Whether it's clothing, towels, or bedding, rest assured that this hamper can accommodate your laundry needs PRACTICAL SPECIFICATIONS: Shape: Round. Volume: 68L. Dimensions: 16.54\" Length x 16.54\" Width x 21.26\" Height. Weight: 0.9 lbs. These dimensions and weight ensure a perfect balance between size and portability, making it easy to maneuver and store","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xA2rVuHwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIRDROCK HOME","source_asin":"B09VCR51P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VCR51P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VCR51P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796872,"name":"WALLOP Damascus Paring Knife 3.5 inch - Japanese AUS-10 High Carbon Damascus Steel - Peeling Knife - Fruit Vegetable Knife with Ergonomic G10 Handle w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ne+s4NvjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALLOP Ring-R Series knives The Ring series is characterized by Japanese super steel, AUS-10 Damascus steel material and exceptional high-end touches. The full genuine exotic handle of Ring provides a contemporary look, secure grip and balance, and is easy to maintain. The excellent sharpness and good edge retention makes it so fast and easy to cut. Ring definitely gives every chef top cutting performance and versatility. What makes a great knife Great knives do two things very well: feel good in your hand and hold a sharp edge. We went through many attempts to create a handle that not only provides comfort for every hand, but also encourages a proper grip for better control.To ensure true sharpness, we experimented with various blade shapes and high-carbon steels until we found the right match. FEATURES: → Japanese Steel Imported Japanese AUS-10 high carbon stainless steel,high quality steel for making professional kitchen knives. → Ergonomic Design Ultra-premium G10 Handle is military grade with life-long durability, triple riveted to the Forged Full Tang for Extra Strength & Durability. → Sharpness Optimal angle designed with 12-15 degree cutting angle, for superior performance and easy maintenance. Attention: √ Before first time use, please clean the knife and pay attention to avoid direct contact with blade edge; √ Be careful when using and storing. After each use please clean and store in a knife holder or other safe place; √ Please select different types of knives for cutting different foods; √ Do not use other knives instead of machetes to cut hard foods,otherwise it will lead to serious damage of the blade; √ Wrong operation will damage knives.For example: Knives can not be used as a common tool to screw; √ PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE store the knife away from children reach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ne+s4NvjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WALLOP","source_asin":"B07XP41B23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XP41B23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XP41B23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":796873,"name":"Extra Large, Fair Isle Knit Christmas Stockings 2pk. Festive Red, White & Gray Gift Holders With Reindeer Design and Pom Poms. Holiday Socks Great for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h78r-4xKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make the holidays cozier this winter with our adorable, durable knit stockings, large enough for all your favorite goodies. Adults love the sophisticated, nostalgic design, while kids and babies like colors and swinging pom poms. Don't forget one for your fur baby; these can hold a giant dog bone! The strong, quality material ensures that your family will be able to enjoy these essential keepsakes for years. Fill with cookies and wine to make a unique host gift for parties Stuff a stocking with a bottle of champagne, treats and a greeting card to make a cute and festive host gift at a holiday party this winter season. By using these stockings instead of traditional wrapping paper or bags, you create an adorable present AND are being more eco-friendly! The perfect decoration for any office or retail establishment These ornamental stockings are a top choice for any commercial store, restaurant, bar, business, school classroom, shopping mall, or company office. They add a bright cheer that helps us celebrate throughout the joyous winter season! DIY holiday crafts just got better! Buy these socks in bulk to create a pretty door wreath, themed stocking garland or stuff them and sew shut to make funky throw pillows. Customize them by attaching buttons, ribbon, applique and pockets to make a more personalized decoration. The creative ideas are endless! What’s in the box? You'll receive a set of 2 (two) knit stockings featuring a reindeer design. The stockings are red, gray and white with pom poms and a sturdy loop for hanging purposes. Each stocking measures 10 inches wide by 23 inches tall. Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h78r-4xKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eucatus","source_asin":"B08KYDB7CY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-796873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KYDB7CY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KYDB7CY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
